  "title": "Aurabeat, USFDA Approved Anti-Covid Class 2 Medical Device for SARS-COV-2 Disinfection Launched in India",
  "summary": "Bangalore 10th August 2021: Aurabeat, USFDA approved anti-Covid Class 2 medical device for SARS-COV-2 disinfection was launched in India today. Hong Kong-based Aurabeat has developed the patented AG+ five-stage sterilization purifying technology after extensive research in the field of air filtration for over a decade",
